crossings-neighbours         edges two apart are not tried against each other -- NOT caught: every test passes
crossings-sign               the sign of every crossing is turned round -- caught: 1 of the tests fail (theorem2(): Whitney's count by crossings from the lowest point g)
theorem2-mu                  mu is always +1 -- caught: 1 of the tests fail (theorem2(): Whitney's count by crossings from the lowest point g)
theorem2-any-start           the count by crossings begins wherever the curve begins -- caught: 1 of the tests fail (theorem2(): Whitney's count by crossings from the lowest point g)
resample-by-index            the curve is resampled by taking every point in turn, not by length -- caught: 3 of the tests fail (resample(): 400 steps equal to within 2 in a hundred, and the le)
